<title>POLAND: Universal sees '97 group profit rise.</title>
<headline>Universal sees '97 group profit rise.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish trader Universal sees its group net profit rising to 60 million zlotys in 1997, up from its forecast of 47 million zlotys in 1996, the company said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Last year Universal's consolidated net profit amounted to 19.4 million zlotys.</p>
<p>Universal's parent company made a 12-million-zloty net profit last year and 12.3 million zlotys over the first three quarters this year.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
